# Names only. The real file is /etc/forever-market-feed/collector.env on the server (owner fmf-deploy, mode 0600)
# and never enters Git, GitHub, logs or a chat; README.md (section Server) has the no-echo command that writes it.
# One line per name, NAME=value, no quotes. The other collector settings are in compose.yml (not secret), and the
# database password is generated into postgres.env when the server is provisioned.
BLIZZARD_CLIENT_ID=
BLIZZARD_CLIENT_SECRET=
